      <title></title>
      <link>http://localhost:52224/docs/GDD_Design/World/MapDesign/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:52224/docs/GDD_Design/World/MapDesign/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;world--map-design&#34;&gt;World &amp;amp; Map Design&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#world--map-design&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;../Characters/Operators.md&#34;&gt;← Previous: Operators&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; | &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;../README.md&#34;&gt;Index&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; | &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;../Visuals/ArtDirection.md&#34;&gt;Next: Art Direction →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;map-design-philosophy&#34;&gt;Map Design Philosophy&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#map-design-philosophy&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Principles:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Readability&lt;/strong&gt; - Top-down perspective requires clear visual hierarchy.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tactical Depth&lt;/strong&gt; - Multiple routes, cover options, and vertical elements.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk vs Reward&lt;/strong&gt; - Loot quality scales with danger level.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Memorable Landmarks&lt;/strong&gt; - Facilitates easy navigation and team callouts.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;extraction-shooter-specifics&#34;&gt;Extraction-Shooter Specifics&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#extraction-shooter-specifics&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Primary and secondary design factors adapted for the extraction genre, directly influencing zone layouts.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title></title>
      <link>http://localhost:52224/docs/GDD_Design/World/MapDesign_IndustrialZone/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:52224/docs/GDD_Design/World/MapDesign_IndustrialZone/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;map-design-industrial-zone-the-factory&#34;&gt;Map Design: Industrial Zone (The &amp;ldquo;Factory&amp;rdquo;)&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#map-design-industrial-zone-the-factory&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;../../README.md&#34;&gt;← Back to Index&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; | &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;../../Visuals/ArtDirection.md&#34;&gt;Next: Art Direction →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-map-overview&#34;&gt;🗺️ Map Overview&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#-map-overview&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Name:&lt;/strong&gt; Sector 7 Industrial Complex (aka &amp;ldquo;The Factory&amp;rdquo;)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Theme:&lt;/strong&gt; Abandoned Soviet-era processing plant repurposed for anomalous research.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size:&lt;/strong&gt; Medium (1200m x 1200m)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Player Count:&lt;/strong&gt; 12 Players (Solo/Duo/Squads) + 20 AI Bots&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raid Time:&lt;/strong&gt; 20 Minutes&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Difficulty:&lt;/strong&gt; Intermediate (Balanced Loot/Risk)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Narrative Context:&lt;/strong&gt;&#xA;Once the primary refining facility for local crystalline resources. When the &amp;ldquo;Outbreak&amp;rdquo; occurred, the military sealed the exits, trapping workers inside. Now, it&amp;rsquo;s a scavenger&amp;rsquo;s paradise filled with raw materials, left-behind military gear, and dangerous chemical leaks.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title></title>
      <link>http://localhost:52224/docs/GDD_Design/World/MapDesign_NeonSlums/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:52224/docs/GDD_Design/World/MapDesign_NeonSlums/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;map-design-neon-slums-the-undercity&#34;&gt;Map Design: Neon Slums (The &amp;ldquo;Undercity&amp;rdquo;)&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#map-design-neon-slums-the-undercity&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;../../README.md&#34;&gt;← Back to Index&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; | &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;../../Visuals/ArtDirection.md&#34;&gt;Next: Art Direction →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-map-overview&#34;&gt;🗺️ Map Overview&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#-map-overview&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Name:&lt;/strong&gt; District 09 (aka &amp;ldquo;Neon Slums&amp;rdquo;)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Theme:&lt;/strong&gt; Cyberpunk-favela built on the ruins of a mega-city. Dense, vertical, and neon-lit.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size:&lt;/strong&gt; Small/Dense (800m x 800m)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Player Count:&lt;/strong&gt; 8 Players (Focus on Solo/Duo)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raid Time:&lt;/strong&gt; 15 Minutes&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Difficulty:&lt;/strong&gt; High (CQC focus, relentless verticality)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unique Feature:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Day/Night Cycle&lt;/strong&gt;. The raid starts at dusk and ends in pitch black night, forcing players to use flashlights or NVGs in the final minutes.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title></title>
      <link>http://localhost:52224/docs/GDD_Design/World/MapDesign_Wilderness/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:52224/docs/GDD_Design/World/MapDesign_Wilderness/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;map-design-the-mire-wilderness-zone&#34;&gt;Map Design: The Mire (Wilderness Zone)&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#map-design-the-mire-wilderness-zone&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;../../README.md&#34;&gt;← Back to Index&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; | &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;../../Visuals/ArtDirection.md&#34;&gt;Next: Art Direction →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-map-overview&#34;&gt;🗺️ Map Overview&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#-map-overview&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Name:&lt;/strong&gt; The Exclusion Mire (aka &amp;ldquo;The Swamp&amp;rdquo;)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Theme:&lt;/strong&gt; Flooded forest reclaiming a failed biological test site. Foggy, treacherous terrain.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size:&lt;/strong&gt; Large (2000m x 2000m)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Player Count:&lt;/strong&gt; 16 Players (Duo/Squad Focus)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raid Time:&lt;/strong&gt; 30 Minutes&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Difficulty:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert (Map knowledge critical for survival)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unique Feature:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Water Level&lt;/strong&gt;. Water rises and recedes slowly. Lootable areas become deadly traps; new paths open up.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title></title>
